  {"g3:0825926a", "Congratulations for defeating\\nthe FACTORY HEAD and winning\\n\\nseven matches in a row!", "Meus parabéns por derrotar\\no FACTORY HEAD e ganhar\\n\\n7 partidas consecutivas!"},
